<div class="bingo-landing">
  <header class="bingo-hero">
    <h1 class="bingo-hero__title">Simple, honest pricing</h1>
    <p class="bingo-hero__tagline">Free to get started. Pay only when your event grows.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="bingo-section">
    <div class="pricing-grid">

      <!-- Free -->
      <div class="pricing-card pricing-card--featured">
        <div class="pricing-card__header">
          <span class="pricing-card__badge pricing-card__badge--free">Free</span>
          <div class="pricing-card__price">$0</div>
          <div class="pricing-card__period">forever</div>
        </div>
        <p class="pricing-card__tagline">Perfect for small gatherings, trials, and hackathons.</p>
        <ul class="pricing-card__features">
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Unlimited events</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Up to 50 players per event</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">3×3 and 5×5 bingo grids</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">AI photo descriptions (Mistral)</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Admin photo review</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">More than 50 players</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">Feedback forms</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">Attendee contact list</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">Sponsor shoutouts</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/create-event" class="pricing-card__cta pricing-card__cta--primary">Create a free event</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Standard -->
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <div class="pricing-card__header">
          <span class="pricing-card__badge pricing-card__badge--standard">Standard</span>
          <div class="pricing-card__price">$50</div>
          <div class="pricing-card__period">per event</div>
        </div>
        <p class="pricing-card__tagline">Great for meetups, conferences, and team days.</p>
        <ul class="pricing-card__features">
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Everything in Free</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Up to 200 players</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">3×3 and 5×5 bingo grids</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">AI photo descriptions (Mistral)</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Admin photo review</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">Feedback forms</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">Attendee contact list</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--no">Sponsor shoutouts</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="pricing-card__cta pricing-card__cta--secondary">Get started</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Corporate -->
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <div class="pricing-card__header">
          <span class="pricing-card__badge pricing-card__badge--corporate">Corporate</span>
          <div class="pricing-card__price">$200</div>
          <div class="pricing-card__period">per event</div>
        </div>
        <p class="pricing-card__tagline">Built for large-scale events that need the full package.</p>
        <ul class="pricing-card__features">
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Everything in Standard</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Unlimited players</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">3×3 and 5×5 bingo grids</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">AI photo descriptions (Mistral)</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Admin photo review</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Event feedback forms</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Attendee contact list</li>
          <li class="pricing-card__feature pricing-card__feature--yes">Sponsor shoutouts</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="pricing-card__cta pricing-card__cta--secondary">Talk to us</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bingo-section">
    <h2 class="bingo-section__title">What's included</h2>
    <div class="bingo-section__body">
      <p><strong>Event feedback forms</strong> — after the event, collect structured feedback from attendees with a customisable form. Results are exportable by the organiser.</p>
      <p><strong>Attendee contact list</strong> — players who opt in have their name and email added to an exportable list, so you can follow up after the event.</p>
      <p><strong>Sponsor shoutouts</strong> — add sponsor logos and names to your event page and bingo cards, giving your sponsors visibility throughout the day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bingo-section bingo-section--hackathon">
    <h2 class="bingo-section__title">Questions?</h2>
    <div class="bingo-hackathon">
      <p class="bingo-hackathon__meta">We built this at the Mistral AI Worldwide Hackathon 2026, hosted by <strong>UNSW Founders</strong> in Sydney. Pricing is indicative — get in touch and we'll work something out.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="bingo-hackathon__link">Contact us →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
